{"id":51585,"date":"2026-06-05T07:18:40","date_gmt":"2026-06-05T06:18:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/prova-resistencia-terrantez-trail-team\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:43:14","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:43:14","slug":"prova-resistencia-terrantez-trail-team","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/prova-resistencia-terrantez-trail-team\/","title":{"rendered":"2\u00aa Prova de Resist\u00eancia Terrant\u00eaz Trail Team 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">2\u00aa Prova de Resist\u00eancia Terrant\u00eaz Trail Team 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>2\u00aa Prova de Resist\u00eancia Terrant\u00eaz Trail Team 2026<\/strong> desafia a tua capacidade f\u00edsica e estrat\u00e9gia de ritmo num cen\u00e1rio natural privilegiado: o <strong>Polje de Minde \/ Mira de Aire<\/strong>, inserido no Parque Natural das Serras de Aire e Candeeiros, na vila de <strong>Minde<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Alcanena<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>). Em pleno final de tarde de ver\u00e3o, os atletas percorrem um circuito sombreado e acess\u00edvel de <strong>3,5 km<\/strong> em piso misto ao longo de 3 horas consecutivas.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com categorias competitivas em <strong>Individual<\/strong> e <strong>Duplas<\/strong> (masculinas, femininas e mistas em regime de estafeta com troca de chip), o evento inclui ainda uma participativa <strong>Caminhada<\/strong>. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do <strong>Terrant\u00eaz Trail Team<\/strong> e da <strong>Casa do Povo de Minde<\/strong> proporciona uma experi\u00eancia de conv\u00edvio completa, com abastecimentos na meta, banhos quentes no Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo de Minde e jantar de confraterniza\u00e7\u00e3o com entrega de pr\u00e9mios no Pavilh\u00e3o Ana Son\u00e7a.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15p